    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2749270/extras/44cfd49f4e3b7fe774c4687ec4bb5fb6.avif?t=1732951946\" width=614 height=196 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Story</h2>For some reason, you are moving to a new city to live with your &quot;ex&quot; stepfather. And you will start your new adventure in this new city. Working, meeting &quot;new friends&quot; and most importantly, &quot;falling in love&quot;.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Free exploration</strong></h2>You are free to explore a limited area, time passes as you explore, and some citizens or events only appear in certain places at certain times. Hungry? Then go to the restaurant and eat!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Part-time Jobs</strong></h2>The most important thing to live in this city is money, you can work in the bar to earn tips. As the story develops, you can also work at a construction site.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Detective assistant quests</strong></h2>There is an unreliable detective living in the town, become his helper and help him to solve various incidents. In this way, you can not only get a considerable reward, but also understand some of the story of the citizens, and even better, you can increase Juan's goodwill towards you.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2749270/extras/626e91ce3012f3aecae6b2c66c91fb9b.avif?t=1732951946\" width=614 height=276 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Charming Citizens</strong></h2>In addition to the original datable guys, the city is also living many fascinating men. Although you can't date them, there are still some hot events or interesting stories for you to discover.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Multiple Romances</strong></h2>There are some single men in this city waiting for you to meet and date them, develop good feelings and start dating mode to enter a stable relationship. You can be in a steady relationship with all of them at the same time, but it takes a lot of effort to become the saint of love, so challenge your time management skills and patience!",
    "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2749270/extras/44cfd49f4e3b7fe774c4687ec4bb5fb6.avif?t=1732951946\" width=614 height=196 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Story</h2>For some reason, you are moving to a new city to live with your &quot;ex&quot; stepfather. And you will start your new adventure in this new city. Working, meeting &quot;new friends&quot; and most importantly, &quot;falling in love&quot;.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Free exploration</strong></h2>You are free to explore a limited area, time passes as you explore, and some citizens or events only appear in certain places at certain times. Hungry? Then go to the restaurant and eat!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Part-time Jobs</strong></h2>The most important thing to live in this city is money, you can work in the bar to earn tips. As the story develops, you can also work at a construction site.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Detective assistant quests</strong></h2>There is an unreliable detective living in the town, become his helper and help him to solve various incidents. In this way, you can not only get a considerable reward, but also understand some of the story of the citizens, and even better, you can increase Juan's goodwill towards you.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2749270/extras/626e91ce3012f3aecae6b2c66c91fb9b.avif?t=1732951946\" width=614 height=276 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Charming Citizens</strong></h2>In addition to the original datable guys, the city is also living many fascinating men. Although you can't date them, there are still some hot events or interesting stories for you to discover.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Multiple Romances</strong></h2>There are some single men in this city waiting for you to meet and date them, develop good feelings and start dating mode to enter a stable relationship. You can be in a steady relationship with all of them at the same time, but it takes a lot of effort to become the saint of love, so challenge your time management skills and patience!",
    "short_description": "You move to a new city to live with your &quot;former&quot; stepfather. Work, make friends, and explore the thrilling world of romance in this captivating game. Are you ready for the excitement? Let the journey begin!",
